| 6 | `a` is prime                               | a=7,b=0  | description contains “prime”                  |
| 7 | Magic shortcut `a==42 && b==7`             | a=42,b=7 | returns exactly “The Answer to Everything”   |
| 8 | **Combination** – make sure multiple flags appear together (e.g. negative **and** far **and** prime) | a=-103,b=0 | contains “negative”, “far from b”, “prime”   |
