## 2. How to build and run

```bash
# 1️⃣  Save the source above as todo.c
# 2️⃣  Compile (requires a POSIX‑compatible C library for getline())
gcc -Wall -Wextra -O2 -o todo todo.c

# 3️⃣  Run
./todo
```

The first time you run it, `todo.db` (the storage file) will be created automatically.

