| No `MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE` for OF match | Added `MODULE_DEVICE_TABLE(of, …)` | Enables `modprobe` auto‑loading when the DT node matches. |
| No explicit `remove()` (optional) | Added a stub `remove()` – useful if you need extra cleanup later. | Good practice; devm helpers take care of most resources. |
| Missing headers (in the original snippet) | Added `<linux/hwmon.h>` and `<linux/hwmon-sysfs.h>` | Prevents implicit‑function warnings. |
| No `MODULE_*` metadata | Added author/description/license | Required for proper kernel module loading. |

