```
+-------------------+            TCP Socket            +-------------------+
|  客服端 (Server)  | <-----------------------------> |   用户端 (Client) |
|   (Swing UI)     |                                 |   (Swing UI)      |
+-------------------+                                   +-------------------+

Server
