| Item | Why it matters | How to obtain it |
|------|----------------|------------------|
| **Certificate (PKCS#12)** | All requests must be signed with a private key belonging to a certificate issued by a trusted CA (Fina‑approved). | Apply for a *Fiskalni certifikat* at a CA (e.g. *CTB, DigiCert, Certum*). You’ll receive a `.p12` file + password. |
| **OIB (tax identification number)** of your company | Must be present in every request (`<OIB>` element). | Provided by the Tax Administration. |
| **RN‑FTP endpoint** | Production URL: `https://www.apis-it.hr:8443/rn-ftp/v1/` (for JSON) or the older SOAP URL for XML. | See the latest Fina documentation (PDF “RN‑FTP – V2.0”). |
