## 5. 完整示例（包括异常容错 & 进度回调）

下面把上述要点封装成一个 **工具类**，方便直接在项目中调用。示例采用 `length‑prefix` 方式。

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.Socket;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.util.function.Consumer;

/**
 * 用于在 TCP socket 上发送/接收文件的工具类。
 * 只使用字节流，自动处理分包、长度、flush 与异常。
 */
public final class TcpFileTransfer {

    private TcpFileTransfer() {}

    /** -------------------- 发送端 -------------------- */
    public static void sendFile(Socket socket, File file,
                                Consumer<Long> progressCallback) throws IOException {
        if (!file.isFile() || !file.canRead())
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("File not readable: " + file);

        try (DataOutputStream dos = new DataOutputStream(
                new BufferedOutputStream(socket.getOutputStream()));
             FileInputStream fis = new FileInputStream(file)) {

            // ① 文件名（UTF‑8） + 长度（long）
            byte[] nameBytes = file.getName().getBytes("UTF-8");
            dos.writeInt(nameBytes.length);
            dos.write(nameBytes);
            dos.writeLong(file.length());

            // ② 发送文件内容
            byte[] buf = new byte[8192];
            long totalSent = 0;
            int read;
            while ((read = fis.read(buf)) != -1) {
                dos.write(buf, 0, read);
                totalSent += read;
                if (progressCallback != null) {
                    progressCallback.accept(totalSent);
                }
            }

            dos.flush(); // 必要：确保所有字节立刻写入网络
        }
    }

    /** -------------------- 接收端 -------------------- */
    public static File receiveFile(Socket socket, File targetDir,
                                   Consumer<Long> progressCallback) throws IOException {
        if (!targetDir.isDirectory() || !targetDir.canWrite())
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Target dir not writable: " + targetDir);

        try (DataInputStream dis = new DataInputStream(
                new BufferedInputStream(socket.getInputStream()))) {

            // ① 读取文件名
            int nameLen = dis.readInt();
            if (nameLen <= 0 || nameLen > 1024)
                throw new IOException("Invalid file name length: " + nameLen);
            byte[] nameBytes = new byte[nameLen];
            dis.readFully(nameBytes);
            String fileName = new String(nameBytes, "UTF-8");

            // ② 读取文件长度
            long fileSize = dis.readLong();
            if (fileSize < 0)
                throw new IOException("Invalid file size: " + fileSize);

            File outFile = new File(targetDir, fileName);
            // 防止同名覆盖（可根据业务需求自行改）
            outFile = resolveDuplicate(outFile);

            // ③ 写入文件内容
            try (FileOutputStream fos = new FileOutputStream(outFile)) {
                byte[] buf = new byte[8192];
                long remaining = fileSize;
                long totalRead = 0;
                while (remaining > 0) {
                    int read = dis.read(buf, 0, (int) Math.min(buf.length, remaining));
                    if (read == -1) {
                        throw new EOFException("Premature end of stream, expected " + remaining + " more bytes");
                    }
                    fos.write(buf, 0, read);
                    remaining -= read;
                    totalRead += read;
                    if (progressCallback != null) {
                        progressCallback.accept(totalRead);
                    }
                }
            }

            return outFile;
        }
    }

    /** 若目标目录已有同名文件，自动在文件名后追加 (1)、(2) ... */
    private static File resolveDuplicate(File file) {
        if (!file.exists()) return file;
        String name = file.getName();
        String base, ext;
        int dot = name.lastIndexOf('.');
        if (dot > 0) {
            base = name.substring(0, dot);
            ext = name.substring(dot); // 包括点号
        } else {
            base = name;
            ext = "";
        }
        int idx = 1;
        while (true) {
            File candidate = new File(file.getParent(),
                    base + "(" + idx + ")" + ext);
            if (!candidate.exists()) return candidate;
            idx++;
        }
    }
}
```

**使用方式**

```java
// 客户端（发送方）
Socket s = new Socket("server.host", 9000);
TcpFileTransfer.sendFile(s, new File("d:/upload/大文件.zip"),
        progress -> System.out.println("已发送: " + progress + " bytes"));
s.close();

// 服务器端（接收方）
ServerSocket ss = new ServerSocket(9000);
while (true) {
    Socket client = ss.accept();
    new Thread(() -> {
        try {
            File saved = TcpFileTransfer.receiveFile(client,
                    new File("d:/download"),
                    progress -> System.out.println("已接收: " + progress + " bytes"));
            System.out.println("文件已保存到 " + saved.getAbsolutePath());
        } catch (Exception e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        } finally {
            try { client.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        }
    }).start();
}
```

> **说明**  
- `DataOutputStream/DataInputStream` 只负责把 **基本类型** 写成 **网络字节序**（大端），不涉及字符集；文件名使用 UTF‑8 手动转成字节再写入。  
- `progressCallback` 让 UI/日志实时显示上传/下载进度（可选）。  
- 代码里已有对 **异常**、**文件名冲突**、**文件大小校验** 的防御。

