### 1.2 完整代码（同步，放在线程里或 `ExecutorService` 中）

```java
/**
 * 发送 POST 请求，内容为字符串（如 JSON）.
 *
 * @param urlStr   目标地址，如 "https://api.example.com/submit"
 * @param postBody 要发送的字符串（已编码为 UTF‑8）
 * @return 服务器返回的字符串（可为 JSON、HTML 等）
 * @throws IOException 网络异常
 */
public static String postString(String urlStr, String postBody) throws IOException {
    HttpURLConnection conn = null;
    OutputStream out = null;
    BufferedReader reader = null;
    try {
        URL url = new URL(urlStr);
        conn = (HttpURLConnection) url.openConnection();
        conn.setRequestMethod("POST");
        conn.setConnectTimeout(15000); // 连接超时 15s
        conn.setReadTimeout(15000);    // 读取超时 15s
        conn.setDoOutput(true);       // 需要写入请求体
        conn.setDoInput(true);
        // 必须设置 Content-Type 与字符集
        conn.setRequestProperty("Content-Type", "application/json; charset=UTF-8");
        // 若服务器要求其他头部（如 Authorization），自行添加
        // conn.setRequestProperty("Authorization", "Bearer " + token);

        // ---------- 写入请求体 ----------
        byte[] bytes = postBody.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8);
        conn.setRequestProperty("Content-Length", Integer.toString(bytes.length));
        out = conn.getOutputStream();
        out.write(bytes);
        out.flush();

        // ---------- 读取响应 ----------
        int responseCode = conn.getResponseCode();
        InputStream is = (responseCode >= 200 && responseCode < 300)
                ? conn.getInputStream()
                : conn.getErrorStream(); // 错误码时读错误流

        reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(is, StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();
        String line;
        while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {
            sb.append(line);
        }

        return sb.toString(); // 根据实际业务可转成 JSON 对象等
    } finally {
        // 关键：统一关闭流，防止泄漏
        if (out != null) {
            try { out.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        }
        if (reader != null) {
            try { reader.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        }
        if (conn != null) {
            conn.disconnect();
        }
    }
}
```

