## 4️⃣ 完整实战示例：从 CSV 读取 → 分组 → 求和 → 导出到新 CSV

下面给出一个 **真实业务** 场景，帮助你把学习的碎片拼成完整流程。

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.nio.file.*;
import java.util.*;
import java.util.stream.*;

public class OrderAnalytics {
    // ----------------- POJO -----------------
    static class Order {
        private final String  orderId;
        private final String  customerId;
        private final String  productId;
        private final double  amount;   // 金额

        Order(String orderId, String customerId, String productId, double amount) {
            this.orderId = orderId;
            this.customerId = customerId;
            this.productId = productId;
            this.amount = amount;
        }
        String getCustomerId() { return customerId; }
        String getProductId()  { return productId;  }
        double getAmount()     { return amount;     }
    }

    // ----------------- 读取 CSV -----------------
    static List<Order> readOrders(Path csvFile) throws IOException {
        return Files.lines(csvFile)
                .skip(1) // 跳过标题行
                .map(line -> line.split(",")) // 简单 csv，逗号分隔
                .map(arr -> new Order(
                        arr[0].trim(),
                        arr[1].trim(),
                        arr[2].trim(),
                        Double.parseDouble(arr[3].trim())
                ))
                .collect(Collectors.toList());
    }

    // ----------------- 分组统计 -----------------
    static Map<String, Double> sumByCustomer(List<Order> orders) {
        return orders.stream()
                .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
                        Order::getCustomerId,
                        Collectors.summingDouble(Order::getAmount)));
    }

    // 多层分组：customer → product → sum(amount)
    static Map<String, Map<String, Double>> sumByCustomerProduct(List<Order> orders) {
        return orders.stream()
                .collect(Collectors.groupingBy(
                        Order::getCustomerId,
                        Collectors.groupingBy(
                                Order::getProductId,
                                Collectors.summingDouble(Order::getAmount))));
    }

    // ----------------- 写回 CSV -----------------
    static void writeSummary(Path outFile, Map<String, Double> sumByCust) throws IOException {
        try (BufferedWriter bw = Files.newBufferedWriter(outFile)) {
            bw.write("customerId,totalAmount\n");
            for (Map.Entry<String, Double> e : sumByCust.entrySet()) {
                bw.write(e.getKey() + "," + String.format("%.2f", e.getValue()) + "\n");
            }
        }
    }

    // ----------------- 主函数 -----------------
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        Path src = Paths.get("orders.csv");      // 输入文件
        Path dst = Paths.get("customer_summary.csv"); // 输出文件

        List<Order> orders = readOrders(src);

        // 1️⃣ 简单的按客户累加
        Map<String, Double> sumByCust = sumByCustomer(orders);
        System.out.println("按客户累加结果: " + sumByCust);
        writeSummary(dst, sumByCust);

        // 2️⃣ 按客户+产品嵌套分组
        Map<String, Map<String, Double>> nested = sumByCustomerProduct(orders);
        System.out.println("按客户+产品嵌套分组：");
        nested.forEach((cust, inner) -> {
            System.out.println("  " + cust);
            inner.forEach((prod, amt) -> System.out.printf("    %-10s : %.2f%n", prod, amt));
        });
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - `readOrders` 用 `Files.lines` 直接把文本流转成 `Stream<String>`，随后 `map` → `Order`，最后 `collect(Collectors.toList())`。  
> - `sumByCustomer` 与前面示例完全相同。  
> - `sumByCustomerProduct` 展示 **两层 `groupingBy`**，得到 `Map<customer, Map<product, sum>>`。  
> - `writeSummary` 把统计结果写回 CSV，便于后续业务（报表、BI）使用。

