## 3. 通用协议实现（`common` 包）

### 3.1 `Protocol.java`

```java
package common;

import java.io.*;

public class Protocol {
    // 消息类型
    public static final byte TYPE_REQUEST  = 0;
    public static final byte TYPE_RESPONSE = 1;
    public static final byte TYPE_TEXT     = 2;
    public static final byte TYPE_IMAGE    = 3;
    public static final byte TYPE_FILE     = 4;

    // 读取一条完整消息（阻塞）
    public static Message readMessage(DataInputStream in) throws IOException {
        int totalLen;
        try {
            totalLen = in.readInt();                 // 报文总长度
        } catch (EOFException e) {
            return null; // 连接关闭
        }
        byte type = in.readByte();
        int payloadLen = in.readInt();

        byte[] payload = new byte[payloadLen];
        in.readFully(payload);

        ByteArrayInputStream bais = new ByteArrayInputStream(payload);
        DataInputStream din = new DataInputStream(bais);

        switch (type) {
            case TYPE_REQUEST:
                return new RequestMessage(din.readUTF());
            case TYPE_RESPONSE:
                boolean accept = din.readBoolean();
                String userId = din.readUTF();
                return new ResponseMessage(accept, userId);
            case TYPE_TEXT:
                return new TextMessage(din.readUTF());
            case TYPE_IMAGE:
                String imgName = din.readUTF();
                byte[] imgData = new byte[payloadLen - 2 - imgName.getBytes("UTF-8").length];
                din.readFully(imgData);
                return new ImageMessage(imgName, imgData);
            case TYPE_FILE:
                String fileName = din.readUTF();
                byte[] fileData = new byte[payloadLen - 2 - fileName.getBytes("UTF-8").length];
                din.readFully(fileData);
                return new FileMessage(fileName, fileData);
            default:
                throw new IOException("Unknown message type: " + type);
        }
    }

    // 发送一条完整消息
    public static void writeMessage(DataOutputStream out, Message msg) throws IOException {
        ByteArrayOutputStream baos = new ByteArrayOutputStream();
        DataOutputStream dos = new DataOutputStream(baos);
        // 写 payload
        msg.writePayload(dos);
        dos.flush();

        byte[] payload = baos.toByteArray();
        int totalLen = 1 + 4 + payload.length; // type + payloadLen + payload

        out.writeInt(totalLen);
        out.writeByte(msg.getType());
        out.writeInt(payload.length);
        out.write(payload);
        out.flush();
    }
}
```

### 3.2 `Message.java`

```java
package common;

import java.io.DataInputStream;
import java.io.DataOutputStream;
import java.io.IOException;

// 抽象基类
public abstract class Message {
    public abstract byte getType();
    // 将 payload 部分写入 DataOutputStream
    public abstract void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException;
}

/* ---------- 各种具体子类 ---------- */

class RequestMessage extends Message {
    private final String userId;
    public RequestMessage(String userId) { this.userId = userId; }
    public String getUserId() { return userId; }
    @Override public byte getType() { return Protocol.TYPE_REQUEST; }
    @Override public void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
        out.writeUTF(userId);
    }
}

class ResponseMessage extends Message {
    private final boolean accept;
    private final String userId;
    public ResponseMessage(boolean accept, String userId) {
        this.accept = accept; this.userId = userId;
    }
    public boolean isAccept() { return accept; }
    public String getUserId() { return userId; }
    @Override public byte getType() { return Protocol.TYPE_RESPONSE; }
    @Override public void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
        out.writeBoolean(accept);
        out.writeUTF(userId);
    }
}

class TextMessage extends Message {
    private final String text;
    public TextMessage(String text) { this.text = text; }
    public String getText() { return text; }
    @Override public byte getType() { return Protocol.TYPE_TEXT; }
    @Override public void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
        out.writeUTF(text);
    }
}

class ImageMessage extends Message {
    private final String fileName;
    private final byte[] data;
    public ImageMessage(String fileName, byte[] data) {
        this.fileName = fileName; this.data = data;
    }
    public String getFileName() { return fileName; }
    public byte[] getData() { return data; }
    @Override public byte getType() { return Protocol.TYPE_IMAGE; }
    @Override public void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
        out.writeUTF(fileName);
        out.write(data);
    }
}

class FileMessage extends Message {
    private final String fileName;
    private final byte[] data;
    public FileMessage(String fileName, byte[] data) {
        this.fileName = fileName; this.data = data;
    }
    public String getFileName() { return fileName; }
    public byte[] getData() { return data; }
    @Override public byte getType() { return Protocol.TYPE_FILE; }
    @Override public void writePayload(DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
        out.writeUTF(fileName);
        out.write(data);
    }
}
```

> **说明**  
> - 使用 `DataInputStream/DataOutputStream` 简化二进制读写。  
> - `Protocol.readMessage` 与 `Protocol.writeMessage` 对外统一，双方只需要传 `Message` 对象。  

