## 2. 阻塞 I/O（`java.io`）实现示例

> 为了让示例更易阅读，下面的代码都 **封装成单独的类**，每个类只负责一种帧格式。实际使用时，你可以把它们合并到同一个 `SocketClient` 类里，根据业务协议选择对应的实现。

### 2.1 基础网络初始化

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.Socket;

public abstract class AbstractSocketClient {
    protected final String host;
    protected final int    port;
    protected Socket       socket;
    protected InputStream  in;
    protected OutputStream out;

    public AbstractSocketClient(String host, int port) {
        this.host = host;
        this.port = port;
    }

    /** 连接服务器 */
    public void connect() throws IOException {
        socket = new Socket(host, port);
        // 为了更好地读取，建议开启 TCP 的 Nagle 算法关闭
        socket.setTcpNoDelay(true);
        in  = socket.getInputStream();
        out = socket.getOutputStream();
    }

    /** 关闭资源 */
    public void close() {
        try { if (in  != null) in.close();  } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        try { if (out != null) out.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
        try { if (socket != null) socket.close(); } catch (IOException ignored) {}
    }

    /** 发送原始字节 */
    protected void sendBytes(byte[] data) throws IOException {
        out.write(data);
        out.flush();
    }

    /** 业务层需要实现的 “读取一条完整消息” 方法 */
    protected abstract void readLoop() throws IOException;
}
```

---

### 2.2 固定长度消息（每条 64 字节）

```java
public class FixedLengthClient extends AbstractSocketClient {
    private static final int MSG_LEN = 64; // 固定长度

    public FixedLengthClient(String host, int port) {
        super(host, port);
    }

    @Override
    protected void readLoop() throws IOException {
        byte[] buffer = new byte[MSG_LEN];
        while (true) {
            int read = 0;
            // 必须循环读取，确保一次读到完整的 64 字节
            while (read < MSG_LEN) {
                int n = in.read(buffer, read, MSG_LEN - read);
                if (n == -1) { // 对端关闭
                    System.out.println("服务器端已关闭连接");
                    return;
                }
                read += n;
            }
            // 此时已经得到一条完整消息
            handleMessage(buffer);
        }
    }

    private void handleMessage(byte[] data) {
        // 这里演示把字节当成 UTF‑8 文本打印（实际业务自行处理）
        System.out.println("收到固定长度消息: " + new String(data));
    }

    // 简单的发送示例（填充到 64 字节）
    public void send(String text) throws IOException {
        byte[] raw = text.getBytes("UTF-8");
        if (raw.length > MSG_LEN) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("消息太长");
        }
        byte[] padded = new byte[MSG_LEN];
        System.arraycopy(raw, 0, padded, 0, raw.length);
        sendBytes(padded);
    }
}
```

> **使用方式**  

```java
public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
    FixedLengthClient client = new FixedLengthClient("127.0.0.1", 9000);
    client.connect();

    // 启动读取线程
    new Thread(() -> {
        try { client.readLoop(); } catch (IOException e) { e.printStackTrace(); }
    }).start();

    // 发送几条测试消息
    client.send("Hello");
    client.send("World");
    // ……随意发送更多
}
```

