### 2.3 基于换行符的文本协议（`readLine`）

```java
public class LineBasedClient extends AbstractSocketClient {
    private BufferedReader reader;

    public LineBasedClient(String host, int port) {
        super(host, port);
    }

    @Override
    public void connect() throws IOException {
        super.connect();
        // 把 InputStream 包装成字符流，使用 UTF‑8 编码
        reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(in, "UTF-8"));
    }

    @Override
    protected void readLoop() throws IOException {
        String line;
        while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {
            // readLine 会自动去掉行结束符 (\n or \r\n)
            handleLine(line);
        }
        System.out.println("服务器已关闭（readLine 返回 null）");
    }

    private void handleLine(String line) {
        System.out.println("收到一行: " + line);
    }

    /** 发送一行（自动加 \n） */
    public void sendLine(String txt) throws IOException {
        BufferedWriter bw = new BufferedWriter(new OutputStreamWriter(out, "UTF-8"));
        bw.write(txt);
        bw.write("\n"); // 或者 "\r\n" 根据协议要求
        bw.flush();
    }
}
```

> **使用方式**  

```java
