/**
 * Service that validates uploaded zip packages containing resource files.
 *
 * <p>
 *   The expected hierarchy inside the zip is:
 *   <pre>
 *   └─ &lt;resource‑name&gt;/
 *       ├─ 全景图片/
 *       │   └─ *.jpg / *.png / …
 *       ├─ 局部图片/
 *       │   └─ *.jpg / *.png / …
 *       └─ 视频/
 *           └─ *.mp4 / *.avi / …
 *   </pre>
 * </p>
 *
 * <p>
 *   All validation failures throw {@link BaseException} with a user‑friendly message.
 * </p>
