### 4.1 `MessageType.java`

```java
package com.ecom.cs.common;

/**
 * 消息类型（1 byte）
 */
public enum MessageType {
    TEXT((byte)0x01),
    IMAGE((byte)0x02),
    FILE((byte)0x03),
    SERVICE_REQUEST((byte)0x04),
    SERVICE_RESPONSE((byte)0x05),
    HEARTBEAT((byte)0x06);

    private final byte code;
    MessageType(byte code) { this.code = code; }
    public byte code() { return code; }

    public static MessageType from(byte b) {
        for (MessageType t : values())
            if (t.code == b) return t;
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("未知 MessageType: " + b);
    }
}
```

### 4.2 `Message.java`

```java
package com.ecom.cs.common;

import java.io.*;
import java.nio.ByteBuffer;

/**
 * 简单的协议包装类
 */
public class Message {
    private final MessageType type;
    private final byte[] payload;   // 可以为 null

    public Message(MessageType type, byte[] payload) {
        this.type = type;
        this.payload = payload == null ? new byte[0] : payload;
    }

    public MessageType getType() { return type; }
    public byte[] getPayload() { return payload; }

    /** 将此 Message 写入 OutputStream（阻塞） */
    public void writeTo(OutputStream out) throws IOException {
        DataOutputStream dos = new DataOutputStream(out);
        dos.writeByte(type.code());
        dos.writeInt(payload.length);
        if (payload.length > 0) dos.write(payload);
        dos.flush();
    }

    /** 从 InputStream 读取一个完整 Message（阻塞） */
    public static Message readFrom(InputStream in) throws IOException {
        DataInputStream dis = new DataInputStream(in);
        byte typeByte;
        try {
            typeByte = dis.readByte();               // EOF 抛异常
        } catch (EOFException e) {
            return null; // 对端关闭
        }
        int len = dis.readInt();
        byte[] data = new byte[len];
        if (len > 0) {
            dis.readFully(data);
        }
        return new Message(MessageType.from(typeByte), data);
    }
}
```

