## 11. ***Plain Servlet* version (no Spring)**

If you are not using Spring at all, the same logic can be done with a classic `HttpServlet`. Below is a self‑contained example using **Apache Commons FileUpload** (bundled in Java EE containers) that you can drop into any servlet container (Tomcat, Jetty, etc.).

### 11.1 Maven dependencies

