### 6.1 Struttura di alto livello

```
+------------------------------+
| HotelierCustomerClient (main)|
| - BufferedReader console      |
| - Socket serverSocket         |
| - PrintWriter out             |
| - BufferedReader in          |
| - ClientState state          |
+------------------------------+
          |
          |  (input utente)
+------------------------------+
| CommandParser                |
| - parse(String line) -> Request |
+------------------------------+
          |
          |  (JSON)
+------------------------------+
| ServerCommunicator           |
| - send(Request) : Response   |
+------------------------------+
          |
          |  (output)
+------------------------------+
| UIPrinter                    |
| - print(Response)            |
+------------------------------+
