## 4. Server（客服端入口）

```java
package com.ecom.chat;

import java.io.IOException;
import java.net.ServerSocket;
import java.net.Socket;
import java.util.concurrent.*;

public class Server {

    private static final int PORT = 8888;
    private ServerSocket serverSocket;
    private ExecutorService pool;
    private AgentUI agentUI;

    public Server() throws IOException {
        serverSocket = new ServerSocket(PORT);
        pool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(20); // 同时支持 20 位用户
        agentUI = new AgentUI(); // 初始化 UI
    }

    public void start() {
        agentUI.show(); // 首先把 UI 端展示出来
        System.out.println("客服端启动，等待用户连接，端口：" + PORT);
        while (!serverSocket.isClosed()) {
            try {
                Socket client = serverSocket.accept();
                System.out.println("新用户连接：" + client.getRemoteSocketAddress());
                // 为每个用户创建一个会话处理线程
                pool.execute(new SessionHandler(client, agentUI));
            } catch (IOException e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
                break;
            }
        }
        shutdown();
    }

    private void shutdown() {
        try { if (!serverSocket.isClosed()) serverSocket.close(); } catch (Exception ignored) {}
        pool.shutdownNow();
        System.out.println("服务器已关闭");
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        new Server().start();
    }
}
```

*说明*  

- `Server` 只负责 **监听端口** 并把每个 `Socket` 分配给 `SessionHandler`，真正的业务逻辑全部在 `SessionHandler` 与 `AgentUI` 中实现。  

