## 6️⃣  Full “fallback ready” code snippet (jQuery + pure JS)

Below is a self‑contained function you can drop into any project. It handles:

- Fetching MP3 via POST with binary response.
- Automatic cleanup (revoking object URL).
- Optional `onProgress` callback (uses `xhr.onprogress`).
