> **Why this stack?**  
> * Next.js gives us true Server‑Side Rendering (`getServerSideProps`).  
> * `pg` is a lightweight PostgreSQL client and supports the `LISTEN/NOTIFY` mechanism we need for DB‑side push.  
> * Socket.io abstracts the WebSocket plumbing (fallback to polling when needed) and works great with Next.js API routes.

