## 8️⃣ Recap – How the Whole Stack Works

| Layer | Responsibility |
|-------|----------------|
| **PostgreSQL** | Holds the authoritative flight data. The trigger fires `NOTIFY` on every write. |
| **Node (Next.js) – lib/db.ts** | Maintains a persistent client that `LISTEN`s on `flight_updates`. |
