## 5️⃣ Going a Step Further (Optional)

| Feature | How to add it |
|---------|---------------|
| **User nickname** | Prepend the nickname to each sent line, e.g. `Read-Host "[$nick]"`. |
| **Private messages** | Use a simple protocol like `/msg target message` and filter in `server.js`. |
