---

## ✅ TL;DR – What to pick?

| Situation | Recommended solution |
|-----------|----------------------|
| **Small static table, no dependency** | Use the **Plain HTML/JS** snippet (≈30 lines). |
| **Already on jQuery or need pagination, export, server‑side** | **DataTables** – just add a `<tfoot>` row of inputs. |
| **React, Angular or Vue SPA** | **Material‑UI DataGrid** (quick filter + custom column inputs) **or** **ag‑Grid** (built‑in floating column filters + quick filter). |
| **Huge datasets (>10 k rows)** | Use **server‑side** mode (`DataTables.ajax`, `ag‑Grid serverSide`, or `DataGrid` with remote pagination) and pass filter information to the backend. |

