2. **A real clock‑driven rotation** – instead of a fixed 120‑second animation we feed the current time into the rotation angle, so the circle actually spins in sync with a real‑world clock (the second‑hand of a normal clock).  

Everything else – your fractal background, fonts, colours, etc. – stays exactly the same.

