## 5️⃣ Optional Production‑Ready Extras

| Feature | How to add |
|---------|------------|
| **HTTPS + WSS** | Terminate TLS in front of Node (NGINX, Caddy, or `https.createServer`). Change the client URL to `wss://${location.host}`. |
| **Rate limiting** | In the `connection` handler keep a per‑socket counter (`msgCount`) and a timestamp. Drop messages when `msgCount > 10` per second. |
| **Authentication** | Add a JWT token to the login message (`{type:"login", token:"…"}`) and verify it with `jsonwebtoken`. |
| **Persist chat history** | Write every `text` or `file` message to a DB (Mongo, PostgreSQL) and expose a REST endpoint to retrieve the last N lines on page load. |
| **Scalability (multiple Node instances)** | Use a Redis Pub/Sub channel to forward messages between different `ws` processes. (`wss.publish/subscribe`). |
| **Docker** | Add a `Dockerfile` that copies `server.js`, runs `npm ci`, and exposes `3000`. Use `docker run -p 3000:3000 yourimage`. |
| **Static assets** | Put the HTML (and maybe a small CSS) under a `/public` folder and add: `app.use(express.static('public'))` inside the server. |

