```
/var/www/html/
│
├─ index.html               ← the form shown in §1
├─ save-text.php            ← script that writes the file
├─ download.php             ← optional download helper
└─ texts/                   ← (must be writable)
   └─ (generated .txt files appear here)
```

Make sure the `texts/` directory **exists** and is writable:

```bash
